# Project Memory

## Key Patterns
- **Logging**: `private val log by logger()` (from `com.cowave.shared.utils.logger`)
- **Error handling**: `runCatching { }.onFailure { log.error(...) }.getOrNull()` (ValkeyBoostStore pattern)
- **SharedConfig**: `@ComponentScan(basePackages = ["com.cowave.shared"], lazyInit = true)` — anything in `com.cowave.shared` auto-scanned
- **Nullable in runCatching lambda**: Kotlin smart cast doesn't work on class properties inside lambdas → capture to local val first

